WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.035
A mature detection lifecycle program defines how detections are requested, prioritized, designed, documented, tested, deployed, tuned, reviewed, and retired.

2
00:00:11.035 --> 00:00:21.382
It assigns ownership and encourages collaboration among detection engineers, SOC analysts, threat hunters, incident responders, and security leaders.

3
00:00:21.382 --> 00:00:24.136
The goal is not simply having many detections.

4
00:00:24.136 --> 00:00:30.103
The goal is maintaining a reliable portfolio of signals that helps defenders make better decisions.

5
00:00:30.103 --> 00:00:36.209
A strong program connects telemetry, threat knowledge, analyst feedback, and changing environments.

6
00:00:36.209 --> 00:00:40.250
It uses continuous improvement to keep detections useful over time.
